A Gold Scarabese Titan was used, alongside the [[Black Scarabese]] Titans, by Rassimov to spy on [[Dante Vale]] and his team. Later, the Gold Scarabese joined up with the four black Scarabese Titans to summon [[Anubian]]. {{Source|Coming of Age}}

Rassimov summoned the Gold Scarabese to combine with the four Black Scarabese to summon Anubian. However,[[Cherit]] was able to delay them by preventing the Gold Scarabese from reaching the others. When Rassimov hit Cherit with a [[Raypulse]], the Gold Scarabese reached the others and Anubian was invoked. When [[Baselaird]] defeated Anubian, the Scarabese crawled back to Rassimov. {{Source|Coming of Age}}

The Gold Scarabese was unbonded from Rassimov by Dante's [[Sorrowbond]] power and recovered by the [[Huntik Foundation]] outside the [[Tomb of Tutankhamun]]. Dante told [[Lady S.]] and the other [[Huntik Foundation]] operatives that the Scarabese had to kept separate from each other. {{Source|Rassimov's Secret}}
